{"seq":3,"slug":"tidyr-purrr-pipeline","title":"tidyr 与 purrr 管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/tidyverse/tidyr-purrr-pipeline","wordCount":909,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"tidyr-与-purrr-管道\">tidyr 与 purrr 管道</h1><p>tidyr 解决数据形状问题——在宽格式与长格式之间转换、处理嵌套数据结构；purrr 解决迭代问题——用类型安全的 <code>map()</code> 家族替代 <code>lapply()</code> 和 for 循环。两者通过管道组合形成强大的数据处理范式：先整形数据、再函数式地对每个子集施加变换、最后收集结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>整洁数据是整形的前提</strong>：每列一个变量、每行一个观测，<code>pivot_longer()</code>/<code>pivot_wider()</code> 负责在宽长格式间转换。</li>\n<li><strong><code>names_sep</code> + <code>&quot;.value&quot;</code> 可从列名解析出多个变量</strong>，一次整形得到多列结果。</li>\n<li><strong><code>nest()</code> 产生列表列，<code>unnest()</code> 展开</strong>，这是&quot;对每个子集做同一件事&quot;的载体。</li>\n<li><strong><code>map()</code> 家族用返回类型命名</strong>：<code>map_dbl</code>/<code>map_chr</code>/<code>map_int</code>/<code>map_lgl</code> 强制输出类型，比 <code>lapply</code>/<code>sapply</code> 更安全。</li>\n<li><strong>函数修饰器处理异常</strong>：<code>safely()</code> 返回 <code>list(result, error)</code>，<code>possibly()</code> 返回默认值，让迭代遇错不中断。</li>\n<li><strong><code>reduce()</code> 折叠、<code>accumulate()</code> 保留中间结果</strong>，用于合并多个数据框或累积操作。</li>\n<li><strong>参数网格 + <code>pmap</code> 是批量实验的标准结构</strong>：先生成参数组合，再对每组运行时统一收集指标。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"tidyr-核心-数据整形\">tidyr 核心：数据整形</h2><h3 id=\"pivot_longer-宽转长\"><code>pivot_longer()</code> 宽转长</h3><p>「整洁数据」要求每列是一个变量、每行是一个观测。现实中的数据常把多个观测压缩在同一行中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(tidyr)&#10;&#10;# 宽格式：每年一列&#10;wide_data &lt;- tibble(&#10;  country = c(&quot;China&quot;, &quot;India&quot;, &quot;USA&quot;),&#10;  `2020` = c(14.7, 13.9, 3.3),&#10;  `2021` = c(14.8, 14.0, 3.3),&#10;  `2022` = c(14.9, 14.1, 3.4)&#10;)&#10;&#10;# 长格式：year 成为变量&#10;long_data &lt;- wide_data |&gt;&#10;  pivot_longer(&#10;    cols = `2020`:`2022`,&#10;    names_to = &quot;year&quot;,&#10;    values_to = &quot;population&quot;,&#10;    names_transform = as.integer&#10;  )\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(tidyr)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 宽格式：每年一列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wide_data &#x3C;- tibble(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  country = c(\"China\", \"India\", \"USA\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  `2020` = c(14.7, 13.9, 3.3),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  `2021` = c(14.8, 14.0, 3.3),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  `2022` = c(14.9, 14.1, 3.4)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 长格式：year 成为变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>long_data &#x3C;- wide_data |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pivot_longer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    cols = `2020`:`2022`,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    names_to = \"year\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    values_to = \"population\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    names_transform = as.integer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>pivot_longer()</code> 的进阶用法——从列名解析多个变量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 列名包含两个信息：指标类型和年份&#10;df &lt;- tibble(&#10;  id = 1:3,&#10;  score_2020 = c(80, 85, 90),&#10;  score_2021 = c(82, 87, 92),&#10;  rank_2020 = c(3, 2, 1),&#10;  rank_2021 = c(3, 2, 1)&#10;)&#10;&#10;df |&gt; pivot_longer(&#10;  cols = -id,&#10;  names_to = c(&quot;.value&quot;, &quot;year&quot;),&#10;  names_sep = &quot;_&quot;&#10;)&#10;# 结果有 id, year, score, rank 四列\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 列名包含两个信息：指标类型和年份</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>df &#x3C;- tibble(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id = 1:3,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  score_2020 = c(80, 85, 90),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  score_2021 = c(82, 87, 92),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rank_2020 = c(3, 2, 1),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rank_2021 = c(3, 2, 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>df |> pivot_longer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  cols = -id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  names_to = c(\".value\", \"year\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  names_sep = \"_\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 结果有 id, year, score, rank 四列</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"pivot_wider-长转宽\"><code>pivot_wider()</code> 长转宽</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"long_data |&gt;&#10;  pivot_wider(&#10;    names_from = year,&#10;    values_from = population,&#10;    names_prefix = &quot;pop_&quot;&#10;  )\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>long_data |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pivot_wider(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    names_from = year,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    values_from = population,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    names_prefix = \"pop_\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"嵌套与展开\">嵌套与展开</h3><p><code>nest()</code> 将数据框按分组变量嵌套为列表列（list-column），<code>unnest()</code> 做逆操作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 按物种嵌套&#10;nested &lt;- penguins |&gt;&#10;  group_by(species) |&gt;&#10;  nest()&#10;# tibble: 3 × 2&#10;# species  data&#10;# Adelie   &lt;tibble [152 × 7]&gt;&#10;# Chinstrap &lt;tibble [68 × 7]&gt;&#10;# Gentoo   &lt;tibble [124 × 7]&gt;&#10;&#10;# 展开&#10;nested |&gt; unnest(data)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 按物种嵌套</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>nested &#x3C;- penguins |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  group_by(species) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  nest()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># tibble: 3 × 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># species  data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Adelie   &#x3C;tibble [152 × 7]></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Chinstrap &#x3C;tibble [68 × 7]></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Gentoo   &#x3C;tibble [124 × 7]></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 展开</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>nested |> unnest(data)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>嵌套数据是 purrr 列表列操作的基础——对每个子数据框应用模型、提取统计量、生成图表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"purrr-类型安全的函数式迭代\">purrr：类型安全的函数式迭代</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[输入] --&gt; B{map 变体选择}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;返回列表&quot;| C[map]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;返回双精度向量&quot;| D[map_dbl]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;返回整数向量&quot;| E[map_int]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;返回字符向量&quot;| F[map_chr]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;返回逻辑向量&quot;| G[map_lgl]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;返回数据框&quot;| H[map_dfr / list_rbind]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;两输入并行&quot;| I[map2 / map2_dbl]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;多输入并行&quot;| J[pmap]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;只为副作用&quot;| K[walk / walk2]\">graph TD\n    A[输入] --&gt; B{map 变体选择}\n    B --&gt;|\"返回列表\"| C[map]\n    B --&gt;|\"返回双精度向量\"| D[map_dbl]\n    B --&gt;|\"返回整数向量\"| E[map_int]\n    B --&gt;|\"返回字符向量\"| F[map_chr]\n    B --&gt;|\"返回逻辑向量\"| G[map_lgl]\n    B --&gt;|\"返回数据框\"| H[map_dfr / list_rbind]\n    B --&gt;|\"两输入并行\"| I[map2 / map2_dbl]\n    B --&gt;|\"多输入并行\"| J[pmap]\n    B --&gt;|\"只为副作用\"| K[walk / walk2]</pre><h3 id=\"基础-map-家族\">基础 <code>map()</code> 家族</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>返回类型</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>map(.x, .f)</code></td>\n<td>list</td>\n<td>通用迭代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>map_dbl(.x, .f)</code></td>\n<td>double vector</td>\n<td>数值提取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>map_chr(.x, .f)</code></td>\n<td>character vector</td>\n<td>字符提取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>map_lgl(.x, .f)</code></td>\n<td>logical vector</td>\n<td>条件检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>map_int(.x, .f)</code></td>\n<td>integer vector</td>\n<td>整数提取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>map2(.x, .y, .f)</code></td>\n<td>list</td>\n<td>双输入并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pmap(.l, .f)</code></td>\n<td>list</td>\n<td>多输入并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>walk(.x, .f)</code></td>\n<td>invisible(.x)</td>\n<td>副作用（写文件等）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(purrr)&#10;&#10;# 对列表每个元素计算长度&#10;lengths &lt;- map_int(my_list, length)&#10;&#10;# 对两个列表并行操作&#10;map2_dbl(prices, quantities, \\(p, q) p * q)&#10;&#10;# 从数据框的每行提取参数&#10;params &lt;- tibble(mean = 1:3, sd = c(0.1, 0.5, 1.0), n = c(10, 20, 30))&#10;samples &lt;- pmap(params, \\(mean, sd, n) rnorm(n, mean, sd))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(purrr)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 对列表每个元素计算长度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lengths &#x3C;- map_int(my_list, length)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 对两个列表并行操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>map2_dbl(prices, quantities, \\(p, q) p * q)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 从数据框的每行提取参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>params &#x3C;- tibble(mean = 1:3, sd = c(0.1, 0.5, 1.0), n = c(10, 20, 30))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>samples &#x3C;- pmap(params, \\(mean, sd, n) rnorm(n, mean, sd))</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"列表列工作流\">列表列工作流</h3><p>嵌套数据 + purrr 的组合模式——对每组数据拟合模型、提取系数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"models &lt;- penguins |&gt;&#10;  group_by(species) |&gt;&#10;  nest() |&gt;&#10;  mutate(&#10;    model = map(data, \\(df) lm(body_mass_g ~ bill_length_mm + flipper_length_mm, data = df)),&#10;    tidied = map(model, broom::tidy),&#10;    glanced = map(model, broom::glance),&#10;    r_squared = map_dbl(glanced, \\(g) g$r.squared)&#10;  )&#10;&#10;# 展开系数表&#10;models |&gt;&#10;  select(species, tidied) |&gt;&#10;  unnest(tidied)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>models &#x3C;- penguins |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  group_by(species) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  nest() |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  mutate(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    model = map(data, \\(df) lm(body_mass_g ~ bill_length_mm + flipper_length_mm, data = df)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tidied = map(model, broom::tidy),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    glanced = map(model, broom::glance),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    r_squared = map_dbl(glanced, \\(g) g$r.squared)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 展开系数表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>models |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  select(species, tidied) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  unnest(tidied)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个模式的核心洞察：把模型对象存在列表列中，用 <code>map()</code> 统一施加操作，最后 <code>unnest()</code> 收集结果。它让「对每个子集做同一件事」的表达变得声明式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"错误处理-safely-与-possibly\">错误处理：<code>safely()</code> 与 <code>possibly()</code></h2><p>生产代码中，迭代操作可能在某些元素上失败。purrr 提供了函数修饰器处理异常：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# safely 返回 list(result, error)&#10;safe_log &lt;- safely(log)&#10;results &lt;- map(list(1, -1, &quot;a&quot;, 10), safe_log)&#10;# 提取成功结果&#10;map(results, &quot;result&quot;) |&gt; compact()&#10;&#10;# possibly 失败时返回默认值&#10;map_dbl(list(1, -1, &quot;a&quot;, 10), possibly(log, otherwise = NA_real_))&#10;&#10;# 实际场景：批量读取可能不存在的文件&#10;files &lt;- c(&quot;data1.csv&quot;, &quot;missing.csv&quot;, &quot;data3.csv&quot;)&#10;data &lt;- map(files, possibly(readr::read_csv, otherwise = NULL)) |&gt; compact()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># safely 返回 list(result, error)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>safe_log &#x3C;- safely(log)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>results &#x3C;- map(list(1, -1, \"a\", 10), safe_log)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 提取成功结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>map(results, \"result\") |> compact()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># possibly 失败时返回默认值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>map_dbl(list(1, -1, \"a\", 10), possibly(log, otherwise = NA_real_))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 实际场景：批量读取可能不存在的文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>files &#x3C;- c(\"data1.csv\", \"missing.csv\", \"data3.csv\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data &#x3C;- map(files, possibly(readr::read_csv, otherwise = NULL)) |> compact()</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"管道组合实战\">管道组合实战</h2><h3 id=\"批量建模与可视化\">批量建模与可视化</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 对每个分组：拟合模型 → 生成预测 → 绘图&#10;results &lt;- penguins |&gt;&#10;  group_by(species) |&gt;&#10;  nest() |&gt;&#10;  mutate(&#10;    model = map(data, \\(df) loess(body_mass_g ~ bill_length_mm, data = df)),&#10;    predictions = map2(model, data, \\(mod, df) {&#10;      df |&gt; mutate(predicted = predict(mod))&#10;    }),&#10;    plot = map2(predictions, species, \\(df, sp) {&#10;      ggplot(df, aes(x = bill_length_mm)) +&#10;        geom_point(aes(y = body_mass_g), alpha = 0.5) +&#10;        geom_line(aes(y = predicted), color = &quot;red&quot;, linewidth = 1) +&#10;        labs(title = sp)&#10;    })&#10;  )&#10;&#10;# 保存所有图片&#10;walk2(results$plot, results$species,&#10;      \\(p, name) ggsave(paste0(name, &quot;.png&quot;), p, width = 6, height = 4))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 对每个分组：拟合模型 → 生成预测 → 绘图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>results &#x3C;- penguins |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  group_by(species) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  nest() |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  mutate(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    model = map(data, \\(df) loess(body_mass_g ~ bill_length_mm, data = df)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    predictions = map2(model, data, \\(mod, df) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      df |> mutate(predicted = predict(mod))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    plot = map2(predictions, species, \\(df, sp) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ggplot(df, aes(x = bill_length_mm)) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        geom_point(aes(y = body_mass_g), alpha = 0.5) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        geom_line(aes(y = predicted), color = \"red\", linewidth = 1) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        labs(title = sp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 保存所有图片</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>walk2(results$plot, results$species,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      \\(p, name) ggsave(paste0(name, \".png\"), p, width = 6, height = 4))</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"reduce-与-accumulate\"><code>reduce()</code> 与 <code>accumulate()</code></h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 合并多个数据框（左连接链）&#10;dfs &lt;- list(base_df, scores_df, demographics_df, geo_df)&#10;final &lt;- reduce(dfs, left_join, by = &quot;id&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 累积合并（保留中间结果）&#10;intermediate &lt;- accumulate(dfs, left_join, by = &quot;id&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 合并多个数据框（左连接链）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dfs &#x3C;- list(base_df, scores_df, demographics_df, geo_df)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final &#x3C;- reduce(dfs, left_join, by = \"id\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 累积合并（保留中间结果）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>intermediate &#x3C;- accumulate(dfs, left_join, by = \"id\")</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"list_rbind-list_cbind\"><code>list_rbind()</code> / <code>list_cbind()</code></h3><p>purrr 1.0+ 推荐使用 <code>list_rbind()</code> 替代已废弃的 <code>map_dfr()</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 批量读取 CSV 并合并&#10;csv_files |&gt;&#10;  map(readr::read_csv) |&gt;&#10;  list_rbind()&#10;&#10;# 等价于旧写法（已废弃）&#10;# map_dfr(csv_files, readr::read_csv)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 批量读取 CSV 并合并</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>csv_files |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  map(readr::read_csv) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  list_rbind()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 等价于旧写法（已废弃）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># map_dfr(csv_files, readr::read_csv)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"crossing-与-expand_grid-参数网格\"><code>crossing()</code> 与 <code>expand_grid()</code> 参数网格</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 生成参数组合网格&#10;params &lt;- expand_grid(&#10;  alpha = c(0.01, 0.05, 0.1),&#10;  lambda = 10^seq(-4, 0, length.out = 5),&#10;  fold = 1:5&#10;)&#10;&#10;# 对每组参数运行实验&#10;results &lt;- params |&gt;&#10;  mutate(metric = pmap_dbl(list(alpha, lambda, fold), run_experiment))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 生成参数组合网格</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>params &#x3C;- expand_grid(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  alpha = c(0.01, 0.05, 0.1),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  lambda = 10^seq(-4, 0, length.out = 5),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  fold = 1:5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 对每组参数运行实验</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>results &#x3C;- params |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  mutate(metric = pmap_dbl(list(alpha, lambda, fold), run_experiment))</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与-dplyr-的协作模式\">与 dplyr 的协作模式</h2><p>tidyr + purrr 与 dplyr 形成完整工具链：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>dplyr</strong>（<a href=\"dplyr-data-manipulation\">数据操作</a>）：filter → mutate → group_by → summarise</li>\n<li><strong>tidyr</strong>：pivot 整形 → nest 嵌套</li>\n<li><strong>purrr</strong>：map 迭代 → 提取结果 → unnest 展开</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 完整管道：读取 → 清洗 → 建模 → 汇总&#10;final_report &lt;- raw_files |&gt;&#10;  map(readr::read_csv) |&gt;&#10;  list_rbind() |&gt;&#10;  filter(!is.na(outcome)) |&gt;&#10;  group_by(treatment) |&gt;&#10;  nest() |&gt;&#10;  mutate(&#10;    model = map(data, \\(d) glm(outcome ~ age + sex, data = d, family = binomial)),&#10;    summary = map(model, broom::tidy)&#10;  ) |&gt;&#10;  select(treatment, summary) |&gt;&#10;  unnest(summary) |&gt;&#10;  filter(term != &quot;(Intercept)&quot;) |&gt;&#10;  mutate(odds_ratio = exp(estimate))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 完整管道：读取 → 清洗 → 建模 → 汇总</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final_report &#x3C;- raw_files |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  map(readr::read_csv) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  list_rbind() |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  filter(!is.na(outcome)) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  group_by(treatment) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  nest() |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  mutate(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    model = map(data, \\(d) glm(outcome ~ age + sex, data = d, family = binomial)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    summary = map(model, broom::tidy)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  select(treatment, summary) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  unnest(summary) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  filter(term != \"(Intercept)\") |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  mutate(odds_ratio = exp(estimate))</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种从原始数据到最终报告的单一管道表达，体现了 tidyverse 的设计哲学：每一步都有明确语义，整体从上到下阅读即可理解数据流。对于可视化这些结果，<a href=\"ggplot2-visualization\">ggplot2 可视化体系</a>提供了声明式的图形语法接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>tidyr 解决形状问题，purrr 解决迭代问题，两者通过管道组合成完整的整形—迭代—收集流水线。</li>\n<li><code>pivot_longer()</code> 是进入 ggplot2 的前置步骤，<code>pivot_wider()</code> 负责相反的展示向整形。</li>\n<li>列表列工作流（nest → map → unnest）把&quot;对每个子集做同一件事&quot;表达为声明式代码，模型对象可以安全地存放在列表中。</li>\n<li><code>map()</code> 家族按返回类型命名，配合 <code>list_rbind()</code> 取代了已废弃的 <code>map_dfr()</code>。</li>\n<li><code>safely()</code>/<code>possibly()</code> 是生产代码中批量操作必备的容错手段，<code>compact()</code> 用来剔除失败项。</li>\n<li><code>reduce()</code> 与 <code>accumulate()</code> 分别对应&quot;只要最终值&quot;与&quot;保留每步结果&quot;两种折叠需求。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"tidyr 与 purrr 管道","id":"tidyr-与-purrr-管道"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"tidyr 核心：数据整形","id":"tidyr-核心-数据整形"},{"level":3,"text":"`pivot_longer()` 宽转长","id":"pivot_longer-宽转长"},{"level":3,"text":"`pivot_wider()` 长转宽","id":"pivot_wider-长转宽"},{"level":3,"text":"嵌套与展开","id":"嵌套与展开"},{"level":2,"text":"purrr：类型安全的函数式迭代","id":"purrr-类型安全的函数式迭代"},{"level":3,"text":"基础 `map()` 家族","id":"基础-map-家族"},{"level":3,"text":"列表列工作流","id":"列表列工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"错误处理：`safely()` 与 `possibly()`","id":"错误处理-safely-与-possibly"},{"level":2,"text":"管道组合实战","id":"管道组合实战"},{"level":3,"text":"批量建模与可视化","id":"批量建模与可视化"},{"level":3,"text":"`reduce()` 与 `accumulate()`","id":"reduce-与-accumulate"},{"level":3,"text":"`list_rbind()` / `list_cbind()`","id":"list_rbind-list_cbind"},{"level":2,"text":"`crossing()` 与 `expand_grid()` 参数网格","id":"crossing-与-expand_grid-参数网格"},{"level":2,"text":"与 dplyr 的协作模式","id":"与-dplyr-的协作模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ggplot2 可视化体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/tidyverse/ggplot2-visualization"},"next":{"title":"R 统计建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/statistical-computing/statistical-modeling-r"}}